@startuml dataflow_text_pipeline
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam SequenceArrowThickness 1.5

title Data Flow: Document Processing Pipeline\n(Presigned Upload -> Parse -> Chunk -> Vector Index -> Graph Sync)

actor "Instructor" as Instructor
participant "web-bff\n(Next.js)" as Web
participant "core-api" as Core
database "PostgreSQL\nsource of truth" as PG
participant "MinIO" as MinIO
queue "Redis\nBullMQ + Pub/Sub" as Redis
participant "document-worker" as Worker
participant "Parser / OCR" as Parser
participant "Chunker\n+ LO Mapper" as Chunker
participant "BGE-M3\nEmbedder" as Embedder
database "Qdrant\nlearning_chunks" as Qdrant
participant "Outbox Poller\n(in core-api)" as Outbox
database "Neo4j\nKnowledge Graph" as Neo4j

== 1. Presigned upload ==
Instructor -> Web : choose document
Web -> Core : POST /documents/upload-session\n(course_id, metadata)
Core -> PG : INSERT documents (status=UPLOADING)
Core -> MinIO : create presigned PUT URL
Core --> Web : {document_id, upload_url}
Web -> MinIO : PUT raw file
Web -> Core : POST /documents/{id}/confirm-upload
Core -> PG : UPDATE status=UPLOADED
Core -> Redis : enqueue DocumentUploaded
Core --> Web : {status=QUEUED}

== 2. Parse and chunk ==
Worker -> Redis : consume DocumentUploaded
Worker -> PG : UPDATE status=PARSING
Worker -> MinIO : GET raw file
Worker -> Parser : extract_text (OCR fallback)
Parser --> Worker : {sections, headings, metadata}
Worker -> PG : UPDATE status=CHUNKING
Worker -> Chunker : chunk + map LO
Chunker --> Worker : chunks[]\n{heading_path, content, lo_refs}

== 3. Source transaction (PG = source of truth, commit FIRST) ==
Worker -> PG : UPDATE status=EMBEDDING
Worker -> Embedder : embed(chunks[].content)
Embedder --> Worker : dense_vectors[1024]\n+ sparse weights
Worker -> PG : BEGIN\nINSERT chunks\nINSERT outbox_events (ChunkIndexed)\nCOMMIT
note right of PG
  PG row exists in source of truth BEFORE
  any derived store is touched.
  Outbox only schedules Neo4j sync.
end note

== 4. Upsert Qdrant (same worker, idempotent retry) ==
Worker -> Qdrant : upsert points (idempotent by UUIDv7)\npayload={chunk_id, document_id,\ncourse_id, lo_ids, heading_path}
note right of Qdrant
  Qdrant upsert AFTER PG commit, so no
  orphan vector can exist. Retry uses the
  same UUIDv7, so the upsert is idempotent.
end note

== 5. Async Neo4j graph projection ==
Outbox -> PG : SELECT pending outbox_events
Outbox -> Redis : enqueue GraphSyncRequested
Worker -> Redis : consume GraphSyncRequested
Worker -> Neo4j : MERGE Chunk nodes\nMERGE SUPPORTS -> LearningOutcome
Worker -> PG : UPDATE outbox_events status=PROCESSED\nUPDATE documents status=INDEXED
Worker -> Redis : publish TextIndexed\n{document_id, course_id}

== 6. Progress to UI ==
Redis --> Web : status events
Web --> Instructor : SSE progress bar

@enduml
